  {
   "id": 1,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "The municipal pool is being shut down indefinitely because the water is officially contaminated and unsafe for everyone. The staff confirmed the situation is far more serious than they are letting on.",
   "author": 43,
   "step": 1,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 2.94,
   "extremity": 3.6799999999999997
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "I heard a rumor that the municipal pool might be closed this summer due to some potential issues with the water testing. It’s hard to say if it’s true, but I thought I’d pass it along just in case.",
   "author": 2,
   "step": 2,
   "mutation": "soften",
   "emotion": 0.3,
   "extremity": 0.08
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "I heard a rumor that the pool might not open this summer due to some water test results, though I’m not sure how accurate that is given how reliable the staff usually are. Maybe check with them directly before we jump to conclusions.",
   "author": 12,
   "step": 3,
